CHIP MATRIX MACH111
PIN 10 A
PIN 32 B
PIN 14 C
PIN 15 D
PIN 16 E
PIN 17 F
PIN 11 CLK
PIN 2 Q0 REG
PIN 3 Q1 REG
PIN 4 Q2 REG
PIN 5 Q3 
EQUATIONS
Q0=A*C*E*F+A*D*F+/A*B*F+/B*/D+B*D*F+B*/D*/E*F+/A*C
Q0.CLKF=CLK
Q1.T=A*/C*/F+D*E+A*/C*D*/F+/A*B*D+/B*D+/B*C*/E*/F+A*/B*/D*E
Q1.CLKF=CLK
Q2=(/A*/B*/D*E+/A*E*/F+B*F+/A*/B*/E*/F+/B*/F+/A*/B*/C*/D+/A*C*E*F) :+: F
Q2.CLKF=CLK
Q3=/B*/F+/C*/F+/B*D*/E+A*B*C*F+/A*/B*D+/B*D*/F+B*C
